# ==========================================================
# AI Agents governance runtime (Recovery Packages, approvals, audit, ...)
# ==========================================================
# Belongs to the SOMA BlueprintOS platform, rooted at the REPOSITORY root — never to any one application
# inside it (e.g. +Compras). See applications/mais-compras/backend/src/BlueprintOS.Infrastructure/Persistence/
# Governance/RuntimeRootLocator.cs. Never versioned: Recovery Packages, approvals, audit, rollback-audit,
# write-execution-audit, knowledge-gaps, rollback-capability-gaps and profiles are all live governance data,
# not source.
/runtime/
